{"text":"kuruntokai","n":73,"lines":["மகிழ்நன் மார்பே வெய்யை யானீ","அழியல் வாழி தோழி நன்னன்","நறுமா கொன்று நாட்டிற் போக்கிய","ஒன்று மொழிக் கோசர் போல","வன்கட் சூழ்ச்சியும் வேண்டுமாற் சிறிதே"],"tr":["makiḻnaṉ mārpē veyyai yāṉī","aḻiyal vāḻi tōḻi naṉṉaṉ","naṟumā koṉṟu nāṭṭiṟ pōkkiya","oṉṟu moḻik kōcar pōla","vaṉkaṭ cūḻcciyum vēṇṭumāṟ ciṟitē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தோழி கூற்று","poet_ta":"பரணர்","speaker_en":"her friend (tōḻi)","poet_tr":"Paraṇar"},"scan":{"meter":"nilaimaṇṭila āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"5×4 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 19, other 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 13, veṇṭaḷai 5, ? 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"மகிழ்நன்","tr":"makiḻnaṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மகிழ்","tr":"makiḻ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நன்","tr":"naṉ"}]},{"text":"மார்பே","tr":"mārpē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மார்","tr":"mār"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பே","tr":"pē"}]},{"text":"வெய்யை","tr":"veyyai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வெய்","tr":"vey"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யை","tr":"yai"}]},{"text":"யானீ","tr":"yāṉī","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னீ","tr":"ṉī"}]}],[{"text":"அழியல்","tr":"aḻiyal","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அழி","tr":"aḻi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யல்","tr":"yal"}]},{"text":"வாழி","tr":"vāḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]},{"text":"தோழி","tr":"tōḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]},{"text":"நன்னன்","tr":"naṉṉaṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நன்","tr":"naṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னன்","tr":"ṉaṉ"}]}],[{"text":"நறுமா","tr":"naṟumā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நறு","tr":"naṟu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"}]},{"text":"கொன்று","tr":"koṉṟu","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொன்","tr":"koṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"று","tr":"ṟu"}]},{"text":"நாட்டிற்","tr":"nāṭṭiṟ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நாட்","tr":"nāṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டிற்","tr":"ṭiṟ"}]},{"text":"போக்கிய","tr":"pōkkiya","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"போக்","tr":"pōk"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கிய","tr":"kiya"}]}],[{"text":"ஒன்று","tr":"oṉṟu","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஒன்","tr":"oṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"று","tr":"ṟu"}]},{"text":"மொழிக்","tr":"moḻik","foot":"malar","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மொழிக்","tr":"moḻik"}]},{"text":"கோசர்","tr":"kōcar","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கோ","tr":"kō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"சர்","tr":"car"}]},{"text":"போல","tr":"pōla","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"போ","tr":"pō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ல","tr":"la"}]}],[{"text":"வன்கட்","tr":"vaṉkaṭ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வன்","tr":"vaṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கட்","tr":"kaṭ"}]},{"text":"சூழ்ச்சியும்","tr":"cūḻcciyum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சூழ்ச்","tr":"cūḻc"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சியும்","tr":"ciyum"}]},{"text":"வேண்டுமாற்","tr":"vēṇṭumāṟ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வேண்","tr":"vēṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டுமாற்","tr":"ṭumāṟ"}]},{"text":"சிறிதே","tr":"ciṟitē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிறி","tr":"ciṟi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"மகிழ்நன்","parts":[{"text":"மகிழ்நன்","lemma":"மகிழ்நன்","gloss":"chief of the agricultural tract"}],"gloss":"the chief of the agricultural tract"},{"surface":"மார்பே","parts":[{"text":"மார்பே","lemma":"மார்பு","gloss":"chest (with emphatic 'ē')"}],"gloss":"chest indeed"},{"surface":"வெய்யை","parts":[{"text":"வெய்யை","lemma":"வெய்யை","gloss":"you desire"}],"gloss":"you desire"},{"surface":"யானீ","parts":[{"text":"யானீ","lemma":"யான்-நீ","gloss":"I and you"}],"gloss":"I and you"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அழியல்","parts":[{"text":"அழியல்","lemma":"அழிதல்","gloss":"do not grieve"}],"gloss":"do not grieve"},{"surface":"வாழி","parts":[{"text":"வாழி","lemma":"வாழி","gloss":"may you live long"}],"gloss":"may you live long"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"friend"},{"surface":"நன்னன்","parts":[{"text":"நன்னன்","lemma":"நன்னன்","gloss":"Nannan (a chieftain)"}],"gloss":"Nannan"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நறுமா","parts":[{"text":"நறுமா","lemma":"நறுமா","gloss":"fragrant mango tree"}],"gloss":"fragrant mango tree"},{"surface":"கொன்று","parts":[{"text":"கொன்று","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"having cut down"}],"gloss":"having cut down"},{"surface":"நாட்டின்","parts":[{"text":"நாட்டின்","lemma":"நாடு","gloss":"from the country"}],"gloss":"from the country"},{"surface":"போக்கிய","parts":[{"text":"போக்கிய","lemma":"போக்கு","gloss":"banished"}],"gloss":"banished"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒன்று","parts":[{"text":"ஒன்று","lemma":"ஒன்று","gloss":"one/united"}],"gloss":"one/united"},{"surface":"மொழி","parts":[{"text":"மொழி","lemma":"மொழி","gloss":"word/speech"}],"gloss":"word"},{"surface":"கோசர்","parts":[{"text":"கோசர்","lemma":"கோசர்","gloss":"Kosar clan"}],"gloss":"the Kosar clan"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"போல","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வன்கண்","parts":[{"text":"வன்கண்","lemma":"வன்கண்","gloss":"firmness/determination"}],"gloss":"firm determination"},{"surface":"சூழ்ச்சியும்","parts":[{"text":"சூழ்ச்சியும்","lemma":"சூழ்ச்சி","gloss":"strategy (with 'um')"}],"gloss":"and strategy"},{"surface":"வேண்டுமால்","parts":[{"text":"வேண்டுமால்","lemma":"வேண்டும்","gloss":"is needed (with expletive 'āl')"}],"gloss":"is indeed needed"},{"surface":"சிறிதே","parts":[{"text":"சிறிதே","lemma":"சிறிது","gloss":"a little (with emphatic 'ē')"}],"gloss":"a little"}]}],"literal":"The chest of the chief of the agricultural tract you desire, I say to you / Do not grieve, may you live long, my friend! Nannan's / fragrant mango tree having cut down, from the country banished / like the Kosar of the united word, / firm determination and strategy is indeed needed a little.","translation":"My friend, may you live long! Do not grieve because you desire the chest of your beloved lord. Just like the Kosar clan of unwavering words, who cut down the sacred mango tree of Nannan and banished him from his country, we too need a little bit of firm determination and clever strategy to achieve our goal.","modern":"தோழியே! நீ வாழ்க! மருத நிலத் தலைவனின் மார்பினை நீ விரும்புகிறாய்; அதற்காக நீ வருந்தாதே. நன்னன் என்பவனுடைய நறுமணமிக்க மாமரத்தை வெட்டி வீழ்த்தி, அவனை அவனது நாட்டிலிருந்தே துரத்திய, தங்களது சொல்லில் மாறாத கோசர்களைப் போல, நமக்கும் சிறிதளவு உறுதியான மனமும் தந்திரமான சூழ்ச்சியும் தேவைப்படுகிறது.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the companion to the heroine who is suffering from separation. The companion comforts her, telling her not to lose heart over her desire for the hero's chest. She draws a historical parallel to the Kosar clan, who were famous for keeping their word and acting with fierce determination. The Kosars punished the chieftain Nannan for his injustice by cutting down his tutelary mango tree and banishing him. The companion suggests that they too must employ a bit of firm resolve and clever planning to persuade the hero to marry her quickly. The key words are 'அழியல்' (do not grieve), 'ஒன்று மொழி' (unwavering word), and 'வன்கட் சூழ்ச்சி' (firm strategy).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.2],[1.2,1.65],[1.8,2.6],[2.6,2.7],[2.7,3.1],[3.1,3.5],[3.5,4.4],[4.4,4.5],[4.5,5.2],[5.2,5.4],[5.4,6.0],[6.0,6.3],[6.3,6.4],[6.4,6.7],[6.7,6.7],[6.7,8.4],[8.4,8.85],[8.9,9.3]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.2],[1.2,1.3],[1.3,1.82],[2.0,2.9],[2.9,3.0],[3.0,3.5],[3.5,3.9],[3.9,5.2],[5.2,5.2],[5.2,6.0],[6.0,6.1],[6.1,6.8],[6.8,7.1],[7.1,7.2],[7.2,7.6],[7.6,8.56],[8.8,9.4],[9.4,9.9],[9.9,10.2]]},"sync":[[["மகிழ்நன்","the chief of the agricultural tract"]],[["மார்பே","chest indeed"]],[["வெய்யை","you desire"]],[["யானீ","I and you"]],[["அழியல்","do not grieve"]],[["வாழி","may you live long"]],[["தோழி","friend"]],[["நன்னன்","Nannan"]],[["நறுமா","fragrant mango tree"]],[["கொன்று","having cut down"]],[["நாட்டின்","from the country"]],[["போக்கிய","banished"]],[["ஒன்று","one/united"]],[["மொழி","word"],["கோசர்","the Kosar clan"]],[["கோசர்","the Kosar clan"]],[["போல","like"]],[["வன்கண்","firm determination"]],[["சூழ்ச்சியும்","and strategy"]],[["வேண்டுமால்","is indeed needed"]],[["சிறிதே","a little"]]]}